{"id":"471902","name":"瘦肉鸡脚煲青木瓜汤","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"","cover":"images/471902/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青木瓜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1条"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"鸡脚","amount":"2个"},{"name":"鸭掌","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉竹","amount":"少许"},{"name":"茯苓","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青木瓜，胡萝卜削皮切大块。","img":"images/471902/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡脚，鸭掌，瘦肉用清水泡去血水。","img":"images/471902/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"焯水。","img":"images/471902/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/471902/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把所有食材放入瓦煲，加入适量的纯净水。","img":"images/471902/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖子，大火烧开转小火煲90分钟。","img":"images/471902/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"时间到了，调少许盐即可关火。汤色多美，可以品尝了。","img":"images/471902/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：瓦煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}